 |-
 ! Exposure
 | Changes the exposure (brightness) of the game.
 |
 |
 |-
 ! ControllerHotplug
 | Allows the game to recoginse controllers that are pluged-in mid game/run.
 |
 |
 |-
 ! TryImportSave
 | Unknown
 |
