 | {{code|2}}-{{code|4}}: Decreases scaling progressively; for example enabling full screen will not zoom in the game.<br>{{code|1}}: Zooms out as far as possible; for example you can see almost all sections of the Main Menu.<br>{{code|0}}: Makes the game invisible.
 | Low MaxScale values allow the player to see more of big rooms at once, even fully.  
