 | Toggles whether the game obeys the game's pixel grid during scaling. Also affects the mini version of the extra HUD's item list.
 | {{code|1}}: Disables sub-pixels, causing scaled down sprites to get pixelated.<br>{{code|2}}: Allows the game to use sub-pixels, making scaling down of sprites to look smoother.
