 ! PauseOnFocusLost
 | Toggles whether the game will automatically open the pause menu upon clicking outside of the game window or otherwise losing focus.
 | {{code|0}}: Game does not pause when focus is lost<br>{{code|1}}: Game pauses when focus is lost
